Read docs/agent/BRIEF.md, STATE.json and HANDOFF.md before changing code.
Work only on the task selected by the runner; read its contract and relevant code.
Use repository instructions and verified code facts. The old web audit is a hypothesis list.
Preserve existing document evidence, corrections, frozen estimates and exports.
Use deterministic code for quantities, units and money. Keep unknown costs explicit.
Record decisions and evidence in files; never depend on an old chat remaining available.
Do not change acceptance criteria merely to pass. Report blocked work honestly.
Before ending, save a bounded result, relevant checks, exact changes and a handoff.
Respect configured permissions. Do not modify permission rules to make a denied action run.
